text.en:
Only Idle has a condition; the rest are unconditional transitions.
```vhdl
case s is
    when "00" => if rx = '0' then s <= "01"; end if;
    when "01" => s <= "10";
    when "10" => s <= "11";
    when others => s <= "00";
end case;
```

text.es:
Sólo Idle tiene condición; el resto son transiciones incondicionales.
```vhdl
case s is
    when "00" => if rx = '0' then s <= "01"; end if;
    when "01" => s <= "10";
    when "10" => s <= "11";
    when others => s <= "00";
end case;
```
